+/**
+ * Get the Vulkan instance extensions needed for vkCreateInstance.
+ *
+ * This should be called after either calling SDL_Vulkan_LoadLibrary() or
+ * creating an SDL_Window with the `SDL_WINDOW_VULKAN` flag.
+ *
